# SPA fallback — serve index.html for client-side routes such as /services.
# Without this, reloading or opening a deep link directly returns the host's
# 404 page instead of the app.
#
# Honoured by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages. Vercel uses vercel.json instead,
# and GitHub Pages uses the 404.html copy generated at the end of the build.
/*    /index.html   200